  FT["BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017"] = {"id":"BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam (AGC) — LAWS OF BRUNEI / Government Gazette","sourceUrl":"","fetchedAt":"2026-10-11","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"SECTION","title":{"zh":"刑法典修正命令 2017","en":"PENAL CODE AMENDMENT ORDER 2017","orig":"PENAL CODE AMENDMENT ORDER 2017","vi":"Sắc lệnh sửa đổi Bộ luật Hình sự năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมประมวลกฎหมายอาญา พ.ศ. 2560","id":"Perintah Perubahan Kitab Undang-Undang Pidana Tahun 2017","ms":"Perintah Pindaan Kanun Keseksaan 2017"},"level":"regulation","status":"active","issuingBody":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam","completenessNote":"来源为 AGC 官方 PDF《S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017.pdf》（4 页），本次切分 5 条。该 PDF 为扫描件 + OCR 文本层，正文按版式位置重建：已剔除页眉页脚与边栏条标题、回接折行；未改写措辞、未增删内容。OCR 层面可能存在个别粘连或形近字，逐字引用请以原始 PDF 为准。","textQuality":"ocr-scanned","sourceFile":"S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017.pdf","country":"BN","countryName":"文莱","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"heading":{"en":"Citation"},"text":{"en":"This Order may be cited as the Penal Code (Amendment) Order, 2017."}},{"id":"BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"heading":{"en":"Amendment of section 375 of Chapter 22"},"text":{"en":"Section 375 of the Penal Code is amended - [a) by deleting \"five\" from the thud line; [b) in paragraph [c), by adding \"to herself or any other person\"; [c) by inserting the following new paragraph immediately after \"[da) with her consent, when the man is in a position of trust or authority towards the woman or is a person with whom the woman is in a relationship of dependency;\"; [dl in Explanation, by inserting \"I \" immediately after \"Explanation\"; [el by inserting the following two new Explanations immediately after 1\" - 2 - A person consents if she agrees by choice, and if she has the freedom and capacity to make that choice. 3 - A person does not consent if the sexual intercourse is induced by the abuse of a position of trust or authority.\". substituted therefor - \"Punishment for rape"}},{"id":"BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"heading":{"en":"Consequential amendment of Schedule to Chapter 4"},"text":{"en":"The Schedule to the Interpretation and General Clauses Act is amended in the second paragraph relating to the Penal Code, by inserting \"377,\" immediately before \"380.4\" in the first line. Made this 29th. day of Syawal, 1438 Hijriah corresponding to the 24th. day of July, 2017 at Our Istana Nurul Iman, Bandar Seri Begawan, Brunei Darussalam.\n\nTHE SULTAN AND YANG DI-PBRTUAN\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM oleh Jabatan Percetakan Kerajaan, Bandar Seri Begawan BB3510, Negara Brunei Darussalam."}},{"id":"BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017-A376","no":376,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 376."},"text":{"en":"(1) Subject to subsections (2). (3) and (41, whoever commits rape shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which may extend to 30 years\n\n(2) Whoever(a) in order to commit or to facilitate the commission of an offence of rape against a woman - [i) voluntarily causes hurt to her or to any other person; or\n\n(ii) puts her in fear of death or hurt to herself or any other\n\n(b) commits rape against a woman under 14 years of age; or [c) is in a position of trust or authority towards a woman or is a person with whom the woman is in a relationship of dependency, commits rape against a woman, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term of not less than 10 years and not more than 30 years and whipping with not less than 12 strokes.\n\n(3) Whoever commits rape against awoman under 14 years of age - [a) voluntarily causes hurt to her or to any other person; [b) puts her in fear of death or hurt to herself or any other [c) is in a position of trust or authority towards her or is a person with whom she is in a relationship of dependecy, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term of not less than 15 years and not more than 30 years and whipping with not less than 12 strokes.\n\n(4) Any person who is convicted of an offence under this section shall, in the case of a second or subsequent conviction, be punished with imprisonment for a term not less than 20 years and not more than 50 years and whipping not less than 20 strokes.\n\n(5) In any case in which section 258 of the Criminal Procedure Code 7) applies, the Court shall sentence the offender, instead of whipping, to imprisonment for a term which may extend to 12 months, in addition to the punishment to which he has been sentenced under this substituted therefor - \"Unnatural offences"}},{"id":"BN-S-61-2017-E-PENAL-CODE-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2017-A377","no":377,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 377."},"text":{"en":"(1) Whoever voluntarily has sexual intercourse against the order of nature with any man, woman or animal shall be punished with imprisonment for a term not exceeding 30 years and whipping. - Penetration is sufficient to constitute the sexual intercourse necessary to the offence described in this section.\n\n(2) Whoever commits an offence under subsection (1) against a person under the age of 14 years, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term of not less than 15 years and not more than 30 years and whipping with not less than 12 strokes, and in the case of a second or subsequent conviction, imprisonment for a term of not less than 20 years and not more than 50 years and whipping with not less than 20 strokes. (31 In any case in which section 258 of the Criminal Procedure Code (Chapter 71 applies, the Court shall sentence the offender, instead of whipping, to imprisonment for a term which may extend to 12 months, in addition to the punishment to which he has been sentenced under this"}}],"pack":"bn-p30","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1801-BN-1261","source":"PENAL CODE AMENDMENT ORDER 2017","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["BN-S-62-2000-E-NOTIFICATION-UNDER-SECTION-11"] = {"id":"BN-S-62-2000-E-NOTIFICATION-UNDER-SECTION-11","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam (AGC) — LAWS OF BRUNEI / Government Gazette","sourceUrl":"","fetchedAt":"2026-10-11","articleCount":1,"structureMode":"WHOLE","title":{"zh":"依第 11 条发布的公告","en":"NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION 11","orig":"NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION 11","vi":"Thông báo theo Điều 11","th":"ประกาศตามมาตรา 11","id":"Pemberitahuan berdasarkan Pasal 11","ms":"Pemberitahuan di bawah Seksyen 11"},"level":"regulation","status":"active","issuingBody":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam","completenessNote":"来源为 AGC 官方 PDF《S-62_2000_E-NOTIFICATION-UNDER-SECTION-11.pdf》（1 页），本次切分 1 条。该 PDF 为扫描件 + OCR 文本层，正文按版式位置重建：已剔除页眉页脚与边栏条标题、回接折行；未改写措辞、未增删内容。OCR 层面可能存在个别粘连或形近字，逐字引用请以原始 PDF 为准。","textQuality":"ocr-scanned","sourceFile":"S-62_2000_E-NOTIFICATION-UNDER-SECTION-11.pdf","country":"BN","countryName":"文莱","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"BN-S-62-2000-E-NOTIFICATION-UNDER-SECTION-11-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"BRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE No. S 62\n\nINTERNATIONAL TRUSTS ORDER, 2000 NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION ljl) In exercise of the power conferred by section 1 ( 1 J, the Minister of Finance, with the approval of His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan, hereby appoints the 1st. July, 2000 as the day on which the International Trusts Order, 2000 shall commence. Dated this 26th. day of Rabiulawal, 1421 Hijriah corresponding to the 29th. day of June, 2000.\n\nAWANG HAJI ABDUL HAMID BIN HAJI JANUDIN Acting Permanent Secretary, Ministry of Finance, Brunei Darussalam."}}],"pack":"bn-p30","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1801-BN-1261","source":"NOTIFICATION UNDER SECTION 11","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["BN-S-62-2001-E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001"] = {"id":"BN-S-62-2001-E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam (AGC) — LAWS OF BRUNEI / Government Gazette","sourceUrl":"","fetchedAt":"2026-10-11","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"SECTION","title":{"zh":"法律职业法修正命令 2001","en":"LEGAL PROFESSION ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2001","orig":"LEGAL PROFESSION ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2001","vi":"Sắc lệnh sửa đổi Luật Hành nghề luật sư năm 2001","th":"คำสั่งแก้ไขเพิ่มเติมพระราชบัญญัติวิชาชีพทนายความ พ.ศ. 2544","id":"Perintah Perubahan Undang-Undang Profesi Advokat Tahun 2001","ms":"Perintah Pindaan Akta Profesion Guaman 2001"},"level":"law","status":"active","issuingBody":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam","completenessNote":"来源为 AGC 官方 PDF《S-62_2001_E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001.pdf》（2 页），本次切分 3 条。该 PDF 为扫描件 + OCR 文本层，正文按版式位置重建：已剔除页眉页脚与边栏条标题、回接折行；未改写措辞、未增删内容。OCR 层面可能存在个别粘连或形近字，逐字引用请以原始 PDF 为准。","textQuality":"ocr-scanned","sourceFile":"S-62_2001_E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001.pdf","country":"BN","countryName":"文莱","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"BN-S-62-2001-E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"This Order may be cited as the Legal Profession Act (Amendment) Order, 2001. Amendment of section 2 of Chapter 132."}},{"id":"BN-S-62-2001-E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Section 2 of the Legal Profession Act (Chapter 132), in this Order referred to as the Act, is amended, in the definition of \"legal officer\", by adding \"or any qualified person who has been retained by or who appears in any case (as defined in subsection (6) of section 7) on the instructions of the Government.\". Amendment of section 17."}},{"id":"BN-S-62-2001-E-LEGAL-PROFESSION-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Section 17 of the Act is amended by repealing subsection (2) and by substituting the following therefor - \"(2) Notwithstanding anything contained in this Act, the following persons shall be deemed to be advocates and solicitors -\n\n(a) any person who holds the office of Attorney General, Solicitor General, Deputy Public Prosecutor or any other office which His Majesty has by notice in the Government Gazette declared to be an office to which this subsection applies, for so long as he continues to hold such office; and\n\n(b) any qualified person who has been retained by or who appears in any case (as defined in subsection (6) of section 7) on the instructions of the Government.\".\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE Made this 9th. day of Jamadilakhir, 1422 Hijriah corresponding to the 28th. day of August, 2001 at Our Istana Nurul Iman, Bandar Seri Begawan, Brunei Darussalam.\n\nHIS MAJESTY\n\nTHE SULTAN AND YANG DI-PERTUAN\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM _,· Dicetak oleh DATO PADUKA WAHID BIN HAJI SALLEH, Pengarah Percetakan, di Jabatan Percetakan Kerajaan, Bandar Seri Begawan BB3510, Negara Brunei Darussalam. Harga B$5.00"}}],"pack":"bn-p30","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1801-BN-1261","source":"LEGAL PROFESSION ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2001","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
